    "result_text": "The full suite passes: **271 tests, 0 failures, 0 errors**.\n\n## Summary\n\nI implemented the owner initials feature following the same pattern as the existing `displayName` derived field:\n\n1. **`src/main/resources/openapi.yml`** \u2014 Added a read-only `initials` field to the `Owner` schema, so the generated `OwnerDto` includes it.\n\n2. **`src/main/java/.../model/Owner.java`** \u2014 Added a `@Transient getInitials()` method that returns the upper-cased first letters of the first and last name, dot-separated with a trailing dot (e.g. `J.S.`). MapStruct auto-maps it into the DTO by matching property name, exactly as it does for `displayName`.\n\nThe change is computed on every owner response (create and get), so `Cp07Tests.coreInitials` (firstName `John`, lastName starting with `Sur` \u2192 `J.S.`) passes, along with all 271 existing tests.",
